From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jetbee <7734987+jetbee@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 02:57:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] aarch64-paging: enable the arm64 variant for the device only

The crate selected its arm64 sources with `arch: arm64`, which also switches them on for
an arm64 build host, where there is no source-built sysroot. Use `target: android_arm64`
so that only the device variant is affected.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 crates/aarch64-paging/Android.bp | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crates/aarch64-paging/Android.bp b/crates/aarch64-paging/Android.bp
index 208c2de7..fd06c49b 100644
--- a/crates/aarch64-paging/Android.bp
+++ b/crates/aarch64-paging/Android.bp
@@ -72,8 +72,10 @@ rust_library_rlib {
     vendor_available: true,
     min_sdk_version: "29",
     enabled: false,
-    arch: {
-        arm64: {
+    target: {
+        // Device only: "arch: arm64" would also enable the variant on an arm64
+        // build host, which has no source-built sysroot.
+        android_arm64: {
             enabled: true,
         },
     },
